{"text": "The Leopard and the hunter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Could smell the animals. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They could hear them, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But they could not see them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They hunted all day long. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But they caught nothing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When it got dark. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Leopard heard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Something breathing nearby. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He jumped on it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And held it until morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hunter caught something. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That smelled like a Giraffe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Leopard looked at his Zebra. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In surprise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It smells like a Zebra. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it has black stripes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We are not on the High Veldt now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Zebra. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They let the two animals go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they walked into the shadows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One, two, three. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Where is your breakfast now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Zebra.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "L", "e", "o", "p", "a", "r", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "u", "n", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "C", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "s", "m", "e", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "n", "i", "m", "a", "l", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ",", " ", "t", "o", "o", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", 